    {
      "id": "18e40159-5da9-465b-9f78-f4f114e2211b",
      "title": "Passe pelos cartões e observe o pedaço que continua igual.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c5c171f7-2daf-402f-84ca-eaf83cfbbff7",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 1</p><p><strong>Mis amigas son muy alegres.</strong></p><p>Em português: Minhas amigas são muito alegres.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6f720bea93214d05b25529d03675624e_b03-01-mis-amigas-son-muy-alegres.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=tvJF0usTjK6YwLlSBtYlLbl0ZsCIVYmbqIsNW4AZZGEzI3~E5hOY1349sgWcI~JtJ~O6AoebFthnDiX79RE8CmdXKootMontQsMURMVDS6Jw4ZXnUSobZY56HkFYOFjUHTlIH4Sh1jLpgBGojO8smOJy7fjsZ~6LrxJet-ntxos4BGLhd0iZ5qAxEWjEQAU0mq0EGWhEhRZ~vSqLQtgm2joJ5B1eU3IuI1t0nw2iqdTI2qiKCyUV0FgaXIjz32mE9VVcbT46zBvgTAltDuAypUve5cutdBNBfLu7nL8MscdvJk2umXPUdOWZOOmBBq9QSloNFSjww5m0LpFK6HAnLg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "b8ff72c2-7ade-4a0b-a109-9758263fc642",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 2</p><p><strong>Mis amigas son trabajadoras.</strong></p><p>Em português: Minhas amigas são trabalhadoras.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d1c7729589c8463d9f0b09a3f77761dd_b03-02-mis-amigas-son-trabajadoras.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=PgKNdKA3fOzIaReBOqUruHKe0279T4cc9RPAQh9l231pfY-tp7XXerytvLJR64Khu2ENADnOzu5WHHx5Ya~7zN0X3LYDJnoiqhTjXXEI1PTwLTeb~7uXayLbhCYk8oz6QlVLltc6UjvT9JbK6na~dMfmAbH858SEHiSlg2UYhHxfGV7uM4tNIkuatm2VNsnHWJk1YlyGrVtw~I6T4Nl0dR-MFQcTVEppB6xVdLpocA67FZNACo2YzYFnYNk64awboIB6XoJVZN4vqQwL62iYuMLqIYoStGN~M3DgPUWDsS1PZdlB-e9GfG-jpAIgeN0XJYnbr1Ae9cuxH0QNS3EZbw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "8240c9b6-5d6d-4034-bb82-991b61e1d8ba",
          "textContent": "<p>O grupo continua o mesmo: <strong>mis amigas</strong>.</p><p>O que muda aqui são apenas as características do grupo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d7a6e0ce-80d1-4568-8241-24f92178b579",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute a frase e ligue \"tus\" à ideia de \"suas\".",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "65d2c433-ff7c-4f54-8eba-e3f886ff8209",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a fala aponta para o grupo da pessoa com quem você fala.</p><p><strong>Tus amigas son serias.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Suas amigas são sérias.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/90316fe6543446df97b3392428473647_b04-tus-amigas.png?Expires=1794099421&Signature=AWySEplcZtSQXvVAjT168VNMcdGFvNvvwQEsodICBJ-ZzVu5EpmivuM39BfPA9PzrB1f3a9jf6BvA4FH4EPY5KVLjGeyPVs69tvXIWkKofi8WIAUpWRfvcHWD4l4~z3MwCwRXoRH8KK2214QfnL40CjIGa-eR9KO1LlG0LZUdUDrjUW6DZSIXwFQrk4LXiF6EfesGpXb6vxPU78GilLUzYBrLzRhtPuir6siAxIv2eTT-Vzs6sUYDS9mQJnXU~YktTSYY3h2hX4z8yeEyOhZ~t3iffBOAF6Un8badVUPbzfffKla5Xa2rrnra8Zz7H9~e--AZ0BSSUjeb3dGAIfERA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
