        {
          "id": "4e8490ac-b4af-4c10-b832-a5ed06dacef2",
          "textContent": "<p>Passo 1</p><p><strong>Mis amigas son sociables.</strong></p><p>Em português: Minhas amigas são sociáveis.</p><p>Aqui, eu falo do meu grupo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5950749e0ebb435e9eb9122b08e39a2b_b02-mis-amigas-son-sociables.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=vtDOcJXbLn56PvSn0YAhno1AlpvIfKd6vpiw8Jxk5njyMmnAH2GklRPgJ7qs7Cd31mk97IurGREdmpmK6RQnl~C~hBVQdMXAJ~JCieXir-AEt-DPylj1B2a3w7-4suqscMMEqvmqM2P2MWS-LrTJ0rEbZZGHLOHeYO~~ZJP0k63x2kRQqBUF7LLbYbixupppyrzMgEaQcI5~x-POlXWbdfei-WsSAe2DIXaYslP9otP~HRmbUpnfhTC8rrrMKA7EKCtew7oSokvycxKdffgK0sqqhoZONsahbR55GzR4-5DCCmw54liAnUwwv9yZC7RcDvjRaZCW1qMH6~xwtPZegA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "e7942b0d-3a95-4118-959a-27a1e4b8f0bf",
          "textContent": "<p>Passo 2</p><p><strong>Tus amigas son sociables.</strong></p><p>Em português: Suas amigas são sociáveis.</p><p>Agora eu falo do seu grupo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/360cffef9838449c997e7879ac00f6eb_b05-02-tus-amigas-son-sociables.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=Y~6aAZzlA6TQzLEPPbWJ3TJXjsYnTxXaha2u9eFkid5hO50yV6gkrRzWGPhtshKGCD9UDael~eixN0XTZ9UpGbhf1ctyk9nErXiALYmuk4i45tKODVrsjvvyRluV2HEc9FNUVGhYSTU-j2MopRzVaKbm0IexNn35GR4L7rMGn0L8mPU6OHdvmyRt2tQ9buZ2WA1YtDZRMV9BCRtn-3ZWmX5y0UDFCGC3tVH6fW3GVsmAA9ZjnnddZ~DvKQq18-xS6IRPBgBkkNkmYyGSxJRx9clzAkYhKcmhQx5o0PHO6n9FF7Q47mV4Smus97Ub7EodzSpEqj7pRhWnyR5ahEBauQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "c986d06d-0a6b-4bf4-8cbe-9b2f0423cdc6",
          "textContent": "<p>Compare:</p><ul><li><strong>mis amigas</strong></li><li><strong>tus amigas</strong></li></ul><p><strong>amigas</strong> continua no plural. A troca acontece no possessivo.</p>",
