    {
      "id": "cef355f4-2cb5-4e63-b150-81bf4a0951fa",
      "title": "Passe pelos contextos curtos e veja quem define o sentido de \"sus\".",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0697a3c8-64d4-4a09-8af0-02cc8a3c98dc",
          "textContent": "<p>Contexto 1</p><p><strong>Ana fala de Clara.</strong></p><p><strong>Sus amigas son muy alegres.</strong></p><p>Em português: As amigas dela são muito alegres.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1c4a837845ea4d8fa24acf0ae3aa2ed0_b07-01-sus-amigas-son-muy-alegres.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=xF1Od8UcABzpbpKAYmAzy5As5wLxuM5IzBnTeWUiELfB-YyeCorogTKgCowhWm1nhH1m2ul56a9JhV6BNyb5vOLKofenhLv2ElMOu4ZmKORWO1fK0o61M~43MDMT7taNwZfTD9irePQSJ1O~RAqdscZ~sW9Eg0K6gGhHxW~ONUrq~cRoSutAKFwaMnOZnoRFVX4FKzrrUGKCPUrUqcivpvyleZCxQS48vQvk-yEapyJXETNuNRkE620GvoGFuPFiLEpBwWXkc8sXjaqKRYqU-9NKC2Wg~OoONkX2wnayKQ4e9h95bQEuffoYVYc7nNbjcdvqco2vPBVOOrBMVdDerg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "57e10cc8-1903-4410-9013-09280133d205",
          "textContent": "<p>Contexto 2</p><p><strong>Leo fala de Marta.</strong></p><p><strong>Sus amigas son serias.</strong></p><p>Em português: As amigas dela são sérias.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/06397acd5e994c7db1aaa748add60fc2_b07-02-sus-amigas-son-serias.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=Vto5Uxpludhe2Cxm8ZEHsBC6iTGNR-a~FoNh4ATluY-v2~hUe9dBJEkvxQp6MfwB5GZWrxJ0HiqVeBgf5SeqVITLbiPlsdJggG4CA-SmC1tz~X-NCM1PaioHOluPXMXYqFaQZJYpSl1YAB8aH9jaA3zeLIgNaWtRVdoUNidETD6ltGjECI-2GIb6XsAN2k~ljPpMuKuopDf-nYEClcOaS58pLxmb3CQc0j2osJ~SVTqR34omQWt3QO0q5BJI~lGwYXX5SVrIULwfpPSynSleIySDXKhGN0d~IoL0iT99sLH5SB3cLz5GW9qJ6xKpcAUxie83aVB24oKI0vWIgsITSA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "409c7def-eb3e-4a03-a2b1-a1e00bb1f530",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>sus</strong>, o contexto mostra de quem é o grupo.</p><p>A forma continua igual antes de <strong>amigas</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e20ecc77-7689-4b5b-9e9e-f51da7aa0e65",
      "title": "Comentando fotos no celular",
      "description": "<p>Duas amigas passam por algumas fotos e comentam de quem é cada grupo.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Mira esta foto. Mis amigas son muy alegres.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Olha esta foto. Minhas amigas são muito alegres.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6b00c5629f2d4ed4bf81c64e8a4c2c62_b08-d01-mira-esta-foto-mis-amigas-son-muy-alegres.mp3?Expires=1794099421&Signature=DsEYEn07BpsJj~CgsJXd2Z4iV6N8~A-5bgQsj4JEpj8xZRDBw~EiX296Kk9FW0ngQFAhVfBXqcFURMtv7bOFvohpNgdzT8HpCbruMDx80Fe1H7-v-bvZ9VeEOpZY1QKTl5pvClc~~Gtor9RUIK~dM47~3JOf6cW1rk2tDw2D4496J0cfeRHvo-KUfvHTpQbp05ZaUAfXF3KTjQMFMSyWecabqYaavXOJUmRBChZZLWG0CFWQEjYLjtZrv8cC0oufdiMoYwsQ6uj~iFC3dkHY5izfNRB1PurVfKei-J0EOVJ5a8Pa~bBAqUCZ1mIPQd6n2Ql3sG98g6XqkrPvLk2azA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, y tus amigas son sociables.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, e suas amigas são sociáveis.</div>\n</div>",
